  "description": "Advanced logging library with Serilog integration. Provides enterprise-grade logging capabilities with support for multiple sinks (console, file, database, Elasticsearch), structured logging, custom enrichers, and cloud-native observability patterns. Features official ELK stack integration with Elastic.Serilog.Sinks, ECS compliance, and high-performance logging for .NET applications.",
